Keep pod Git credentials scoped to the gateway

Scope bearer headers to the repository URL shared by host and
rumpelpod, including submodule clones and gateway refreshes. Remove
stale scopes when tunnel addresses change and reject redirects to keep
credentials at the intended endpoint. Avoid exposing tokens in Git
command errors, including Git trace output.

Preserve unrelated credentials and inherited Git configuration.
Support nested submodule paths containing equals signs. Integration
tests cover unrelated HTTP requests, nested repositories, and tunnel
address changes.
